121
00:07:43.654 --> 00:07:46.305
Step three lists what each task needs.

122
00:07:46.305 --> 00:07:51.005
The read task holds ten read
permissions, and none ends in ReadWrite.

123
00:07:51.005 --> 00:07:54.430
The write task holds only
