124
00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:58.830
Step four reads decision
D N P six for each cloud.

125
00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:02.204
The worldwide and G C C
clouds run in Agent I D mode,

126
00:08:02.204 --> 00:08:08.193
with agent identities generally available
and agent Conditional Access in preview.

127
00:08:08.193 --> 00:08:13.410
G C C High and D O D run in
