137
00:08:51.972 --> 00:08:53.010
Look for these.

138
00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.500
A client secret on Case Triage Blueprint,

139
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.648
and on Correspondence
Drafting's app registration.

140
00:08:58.648 --> 00:09:02.135
Case Triage Blueprint
inherits every Graph role.

141
00:09:02.135 --> 00:09:05.054
Records Search's sponsor
left on October ninth,

142
00:09:05.054 --> 00:09:08.122
and nobody confirmed a new
