143
00:09:08.122 --> 00:09:09.873
And the top-priority drift.

144
00:09:09.873 --> 00:09:13.550
Benefits Q and A Agent passes every rule.

145
00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:21.288
Step seven reads the sponsor
fields Chapter 2 recorded,

146
00:09:21.288 --> 00:09:24.063
now filled for all eight A I identities.

147
00:09:24.063 --> 00:09:28.635
Case Triage Agent has carol as both
